{
  "segments": [
    {
      "text": "在 Scrublet 0.2.3 的 scrub_doublets 中，normalize_variance=true 表示将数据标准化，使每个基因的方差为 1。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 3,
          "quote": "normalize_variance : bool, optional (default: True)\n            If True, normalize the data such that each gene has a variance of 1."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "当 normalize_variance=true 且 mean_center 不为 True 时，文档说明会使用 sklearn.decomposition.TruncatedSVD 进行降维。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 3,
          "quote": "`sklearn.decomposition.TruncatedSVD` will be used for dimensionality\n            reduction, unless `mean_center` is True."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "你提供的 mean_center=false 表示不将每个基因中心化到均值为 0，因此不满足使用 PCA 的条件。",
      "basis": "USER_PROVIDED_FACT",
      "citations": [],
      "context_fact_ids": [
        "user:mean_center"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "mean_center 参数本身的语义是：若为 True，则将数据中心化使每个基因均值为 0，并使用 sklearn.decomposition.PCA 进行降维。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 4,
          "quote": "mean_center : bool, optional (default: True)\n            If True, center the data such that each gene has a mean of 0.\n            `sklearn.decomposition.PCA` will be used for dimensionality\n            reduction."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    },
    {
      "text": "综合当前条件 mean_center=false 且 normalize_variance=true，降维路径应为 TruncatedSVD，而不是 PCA。",
      "basis": "KG_GROUNDED",
      "citations": [
        {
          "index": 3,
          "quote": "`sklearn.decomposition.TruncatedSVD` will be used for dimensionality\n            reduction, unless `mean_center` is True."
        }
      ],
      "context_fact_ids": []
    }
  ],
  "clarification": null
}
